<section id="about" class="page-gutter border-t border-border py-16" aria-label="About ALTR">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[var(--content-max)]">
    <h2 class="display mb-6 text-[clamp(1.75rem,3.5vw,2.75rem)] italic leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.015em]">
      About ALTR.
    </h2>
    <div class="grid gap-5 font-sans text-sm leading-[1.75] text-ink max-w-[58ch]">
      <p>
        ALTR opened with a narrow mandate — to source matcha directly from the people
        who grow it, and to serve it the way the leaf asks to be served. We don't
        chase volume. We list a small number of blends, change them with the harvest,
        and ground every tin the morning we pour it.
      </p>
      <p>
        The cupping notes on this menu are honest. The prices reflect the work in the
        field, not the work in the cafe. If you are new to matcha, we are happy to
        walk you through the menu. If you are not, you already know what to order.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
